// Title: Replace.exe Usage
// Sigma ID: 9292293b-8496-4715-9db6-37028dcda4b3
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-03-06 | Modified: 2024-03-13
// ATT&CK: command-and-control, T1105
// Description: Detects the use of Replace.exe which can be used to replace file with another file
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Replace/
//   - https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/administration/windows-commands/replace
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_replace.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\replace.exe" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "-a" or ProcessCommandLine contains "/a" or ProcessCommandLine contains "–a" or ProcessCommandLine contains "—a" or ProcessCommandLine contains "―a")
